This package wraps the vendored NVIDIA dream-team ARC-AGI-3 solver
(https://github.com/NVIDIA/dream-team, Apache-2.0), which is imported at
runtime from ARC_GYM_DREAMTEAM_ROOT and is NOT redistributed inside this
package. Its NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES live with the vendored tree.

